      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe this behaviour is intentional, since the order is determine by the order the connections are established to the other users. What you actually want to use in order to determine player join order is to check the player IDs, and that's generally what you want to be using when you're syncing player information over the network. Maybe this is something that should be clarified in the documentation, but I think this is very much intentional.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
