      "value": "@{5f36b82c9ec59c0d1272ffe2|full_name} If it is intentional, then there is absolutely no reason as to why the order of the array should be this arbitrary. It only makes things more complicated by having to manually sort the array for the purpose of making the list consistent for every player, which I have found no way to successfully achieve, and even if it was achieved it would be overcomplicating something which should not require this much effort to accomplish.",
